      "description": "A Black man in business attire is extending his hand forward, offering a fan of cash to the viewer. The scene is framed to emphasize the act of giving money, with the man positioned centrally and looking directly at the viewer. The text overlay reinforces the context of economic desperation and moral judgment.",
